<title>USA: Hercules says knows no reason for shr rise.</title>
<headline>Hercules says knows no reason for shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hercules Inc said it was unaware of any reason for the recent volatility in its stock, saying it is business as usual at the chemical company.</p>
<p>Hercules shares closed at 46-5/8 Wednesday, up 2-7/8 amid unusually active trading volume.  The stock's year-high is 66-1/2, the low 42-1/4.</p>
<p>The diversified chemical company made the statement in response to a New York Stock Exchange request for information on any corporate developments that may explain the unusual market activity.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
